{"id":"gh:1411238837","input":{"metadata":{"description":"DSH 浅绿主题","id":"gh:1411238837","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-light-green-theme","slug":"catEatRabbit/dsh-light-green-theme","topics":["cordis","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","theme"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"# DSH 浅绿主题"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"DSH 客户端的浅绿配色主题。覆盖 `--dsw-*` 令牌，并把选中的菜单项和会话行加粗。"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"## 安装"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"### 方式一：DSH 界面安装（推荐）"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"1. 左侧栏点「插件」，再点「添加插件」\n2. 输入框里粘下面这行，点「安装」"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"3. 装完点「立即启用」"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"装完就是浅绿的，不用重启。"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### 方式二：命令行安装"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"适用于 `dsh web` 这类 profile："},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"桌面版的 `desktop` profile 不能用命令行装，它被应用独占管理。"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### 方式三：本地安装"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"1. 在仓库页面点绿色的 `Code` 按钮 → `Download ZIP`\n2. 解压到任意目录\n3. 按方式一操作，第 2 步改成粘那个目录的绝对路径"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## 配色"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| 用途     | 浅色                    | 深色                    | 令牌                                       "},{"id":"p16s2","text":" 用途     | 浅色                    | 深色                    | 令牌                                       |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| 底色     | `#f6f8f5`             | `#131811`             | `--dsw-alias-bg-base`                    "},{"id":"p17s2","text":"|\n| 侧栏     | `#e3ece4`             | `#0c120d`             | `--dsw-specific-sidebar-fill`          "},{"id":"p17s3","text":"  |\n| 卡片     | `#ffffff`             | `#191f1a`             | `--dsw-alias-bg-layer-1`             "},{"id":"p17s4","text":"    |\n| 嵌套面    | `#e9f4ea`             | `#1b321d`             | `--dsw-alias-bg-layer-2`           "},{"id":"p17s5","text":"      |\n| 描边     | `#dce7dd` / `#cde0ce` | `#2b402d` / `#375839` | `--dsw-alias-border-l1` / `-l2`  "},{"id":"p17s6","text":"        |\n| 品牌绿    | `#3c8c4e`             | `#3c8c4e`             | `--dsw-alias-brand-primary`    "},{"id":"p17s7","text":"          |\n| 正文     | `#283a2f`             | `#dee8e2`             | `--dsw-alias-label-primary`  "},{"id":"p17s8","text":"            |\n| 次级文字   | `#606c64`             | `#9baba1`             | `--dsw-alias-label-secondar"},{"id":"p17s9","text":"y`            |\n| 选中     | `#c3dcc6`             | `#325336`             | `--dsw-alias-bg-module-pl"},{"id":"p17s10","text":"atform`         |\n| 悬停     | `#d8e8dc`             | `#233928`             | `--dsw-alias-interactiv"},{"id":"p17s11","text":"e-bg-hover`       |\n| 设置导航选中 | `#c3dcc6`             | `#325336`             | `--dsw-specific-sideb"},{"id":"p17s12","text":"ar-nav-item-active` |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"浅色一侧是从一张界面截图逐点采样的，深色按同一色相（H≈126°）派生。"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"要改配色，编辑 `lib/client.js` 里的 `PALETTE`，每项写 `{ light, dark }` 两个值。改完跑 `node verify.mjs`。"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## 卸载"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"侧栏「插件」→「已安装」→ 卸载。"}],"truncated":false},"inputHash":"sha256:aec3b5bde701a1c4df305fae2d7da4da92a9f7b6a409b64431681f0642945254","output":{"category":"interface-personalization","confidence":0.86,"evidence":[{"fact":"README称主题覆盖 DSH 客户端配色令牌，并加粗选中的菜单项和会话行。","paragraph_id":"p2s1","quote":"DSH 客户端的浅绿配色主题。覆盖 `--dsw-*` 令牌，并把选中的菜单项和会话行加粗。"}],"id":"gh:1411238837","insufficient_evidence":false,"limitations":["摘要仅依据 README 描述。"],"summary_zh":"为 DSH 客户端提供浅绿色配色主题，并调整主题令牌以及选中菜单项和会话行的字重。","tags":["界面主题","浅绿配色","个性化"]},"review":{"at":"2026-11-18T20:56:04.438862+00:00","level":"automated","reason":"Coordinator independently replayed exact frozen public source bytes, production inputHash, evidence selection, and schema. No plugin was executed; local checkpoint only."},"schemaVersion":1,"source":{"headSha":"7a461fd7f5c6e94fc040dc162db418527adafdf0","metadataHash":"sha256:f43b194602ea6e04709780a7d9c9a38d4e56cd69875888c4d4a01aace3d3f54c","path":"README.md","rawHash":"261364a25e2145e474986c3503a0d0c3bea5b30aa1dee3d3e6d45e6bf0e5cf54","registryRevision":"sha256:04371b59939b1f07e53deb93a538f88188886638c